## Solution
```java[]
class Solution {
    public boolean checkPrime(int num) {
        if(num==1){
            return false;
        }
        int div=2;
        return isPrime(num,div);

    }
    public boolean isPrime(int num,int div){
        if(div*div>num){
            return true;
        }
        if(num%div==0){
            return false;
        }

        div++;
        return isPrime(num,div);
    }
}
```

